== Usage ==

Use this infobox at the start of an NPC page. All fields are optional, and
blank fields hide their rows. Its style matches [[Template:Item]],
[[Template:Mob]], [[Template:Action]], [[Template:Status Effect]], and
[[Template:Levequest]].

<pre>
{{NPC
| race =
| clan =
| gender =
| affiliation =
| occupation =
| zone =
| location =
| coordinates =
}}
</pre>

Use the names from [[:Category:Races|Races]] for <code>race</code> and
<code>clan</code>. NPCs that belong to beast tribes or are creatures have a
race but no clan.

<code>affiliation</code> names the city-state or nation the NPC serves.
<code>occupation</code> gives their role, if known.

<code>zone</code>, <code>location</code>, and <code>coordinates</code> describe
where the NPC is found. Link the zone only if its page exists. Use plain text
for a smaller area without a page.
</noinclude>
